      "id": "1128868276526655",
      "score": 5,
      "review_title": "Awesome",
      "review_description": "RICO brings a cool mix of open-world freedom, cars, and multiplayer roleplay to VR! Exploring Ocean City, customizing your ride, and building your character gives you plenty to get into. The freedom to choose your own path is a big part of the appeal—whether that’s chasing money, getting into the action, or just cruising around with friends. Love seeing developers bring this kind of ambitious experience to VR. Looking forward to seeing the community grow and what comes next!",
      "date": 1793412628,
      "review_helpful_count": 13,
      "author_display_name": "Khafzone",
      "author_alias": "Khafzone",
      "developer_response": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1059146553803910",
      "score": 5,
      "review_title": "This is a blessing right before GTA 6",
      "review_description": "Honestly, this is what we wanted 🔥 a developer that understands the culture and knows what gamers wanna do.  GTA is my favorite game, and this crushes all other competition on Meta Quest  as far as being closest to a quality GTA game, can rob banks, rob stash houses, buy cars that are actually quality and real world based, you can mod cars, buy property, theres a music studio that actually works and all this is online with friends.... 5 star for the effort Alone. Thanks you.... I almost thought nobody could make a good open world game.. Then here comes Trap life 2.  I also played the other GTA games on here and beta test and nothing comes close to this... Theres even a strip club.... So if you know you know 🔥 see you online gang!!!",
      "date": 1793481605,
      "review_helpful_count": 7,
      "author_display_name": "My.king",
      "author_alias": "My.king",
      "developer_response": null
    },
